[0.001, "o", "\u001b[32m╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;32mOne Country.iso_code joins this to health-systems-kg & \u001b[0m                      \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m \u001b[1;32mhealth-determinants-kg\u001b[0m — outbreak signal, response capacity,                 \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m│\u001b[0m and social drivers answered on a single engine, one Cypher query.            \u001b[32m│\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
